[10] [action_executed] General_Hospital_Surgery id=full-s0-b0-e9 payload={"action_params":{"broadcast_message":{"General_Hospital_Surgery":{"message":"General_Hospital_Surgery: Scheduling Surgery (step_index 2) for Patient_7 @H14 and Patient_6 @H18 at General_Hospital. Radiology must complete first (P7@H13, P6@H17). Ward can begin P7@H18, P6@H22. Inventory sufficient. Please avoid duplicate Surgery scheduling for these patients.","rationale":"Coordinate Surgery timing with Radiology and Ward agents, and de-duplicate P6/P7 surgery across hospitals."}}},"action_type":null,"details":{"result":"BROADCAST: 'General_Hospital_Surgery: Scheduling Surgery (step_index 2) for Patient_7 @H14 and Patient_6 @H18 at General_Hospital. Radiology must complete first (P7@H13, P6@H17). Ward can begin P7@H18, P6@H22. Inventory sufficient. Please avoid duplicate Surgery scheduling for these patients.'. (Internal Rationale: Coordinate Surgery timing with Radiology and Ward agents, and de-duplicate P6/P7 surgery across hospitals.)","state_updates":{"broadcast_message":{"General_Hospital_Surgery":{"message":"General_Hospital_Surgery: Scheduling Surgery (step_index 2) for Patient_7 @H14 and Patient_6 @H18 at General_Hospital. Radiology must complete first (P7@H13, P6@H17). Ward can begin P7@H18, P6@H22. Inventory sufficient. Please avoid duplicate Surgery scheduling for these patients.","rationale":"Coordinate Surgery timing with Radiology and Ward agents, and de-duplicate P6/P7 surgery across hospitals."}}},"status":"success"},"iteration":1,"phase":"planning","result_status":"success"}
[11] St_Marys_Center_Surgery: St_Marys_Center_Surgery: De-duplication proposal. Two hospitals proposed Radiology AND Surgery for P6/P7. To keep each patient's pathway co-located and avoid double-scheduling, I propose: General_Hospital handles the FULL pathway for Patient_7 (Radiology@H13, Surgery@H14) and Patient_6 (Radiology@H17, Surgery@H18). St_Marys_Center_Radiology and St_Marys_Center_Surgery will STAND DOWN on P6/P7 to avoid duplicate care. If instead St_Marys is preferred, I can perform Surgery for P7@H14 and P6@H18 at St_Marys (inventory sufficient: Anesthetics 7, IV_Kits 20, PPE_Sets 31, Pain_Killers 12, Surgical_Packs 7). Please confirm the split so only one hospital schedules each step. (phase=planning, iter=1)
